meta {
  name: Cancel Callback
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/payment/cancel
  body: form
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
}

body:form {
  value_a: {{orderId}}
}

docs {
  ## Payment Cancel Callback

  SSLCommerz cancellation callback. Called when the buyer cancels on the payment page.
  The order and escrow remain in PENDING/UNPAID state.

  ### Form Data
  | Parameter | Type   | Description |
  |-----------|--------|-------------|
  | value_a   | string | Order ID    |

  ### Result (303 Redirect)
  Redirects to `/profile/orders/{{orderId}}?payment=cancelled`
}
